        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Maki Nomiya, Conrad Thomas Lant, Cronos\n- Organizations: Pizzicato Five\n- Products: Happy End of the World\n- Roles: singer, musician, vocalist, duo\n\nFacts:\n- Maki Nomiya was born on March 12, 1960, and she is a Japanese singer and musician.\n- Conrad Thomas Lant was born on January 15, 1963, and he is an English musician known by the stage name Cronos.\n- In the late 1980s, Pizzicato Five became internationally famous as a duo consisting of Konishi and vocalist Maki Nomiya after personnel changes.\n- Happy End of the World is a 1997 album by Pizzicato Five.",
